+`createPatch(from, to)` produces an RFC 6902 JSON Patch that transforms `from` into `to`.
+It emits `add`, `remove`, and `replace` operations, recursing into objects and arrays so
+small changes send only the changed values. Unchanged array elements are aligned across
+insertions and deletions. Equal documents produce `[]`; object key order is ignored.
+The patch is not guaranteed to have the fewest possible operations.
